---
# clangd only searches the source file's *ancestor* directories for
# compile_commands.json, so a build/ child directory is never auto-discovered.
# Point at it explicitly. Relative paths resolve against this file's directory,
# so this stays portable across machines.
#
# Generated by: set(CMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS ON) in CMakeLists.txt
# Refresh after adding/removing sources or deps:
#   nvim <leader>cc      (or: cmake -S . -B build)
CompileFlags:
  CompilationDatabase: build
...
